WEBVTT

01:36.210 --> 01:41.130
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.350 --> 01:43.950
[Episode 30]

01:53.450 --> 01:55.600
[Power Gang]

02:28.710 --> 02:29.560
Mr. Xiao.

02:30.190 --> 02:30.710
Come.

02:31.840 --> 02:32.520
Have a seat.

02:37.280 --> 02:37.960
Mr. Xiao.

02:38.710 --> 02:41.520
Were your parents' remains
safely delivered?

02:43.190 --> 02:44.720
They were properly buried.

02:45.880 --> 02:46.610
That's good.

02:48.430 --> 02:49.360
Chief Li,

02:50.120 --> 02:52.360
why did you ask me to come here this time?

02:53.800 --> 02:54.400
By the way,

02:56.310 --> 02:57.400
at Nantian Abyss

02:57.829 --> 03:00.120
I remember Mr. Xiao once mentioned

03:00.590 --> 03:02.000
the symbol left behind

03:02.960 --> 03:05.490
by the killers
who massacred the Xiao family.

03:05.960 --> 03:06.760
That's right.

03:08.210 --> 03:09.010
I wonder

03:09.710 --> 03:11.770
how this is related to the Power Gang?

03:14.500 --> 03:16.829
That man is also
an enemy of the Power Gang.

03:17.079 --> 03:18.800
He colluded with the Northern Wasteland

03:18.800 --> 03:19.800
to harm Daxi.

03:20.430 --> 03:21.910
As citizens of Daxi,

03:22.560 --> 03:23.470
the Power Gang

03:24.190 --> 03:26.710
has a duty to protect our country.

03:28.560 --> 03:30.960
Chief Li, since you have
such a noble cause,

03:31.000 --> 03:34.030
you should unite the martial world
against foreign enemies.

03:34.030 --> 03:35.630
Why use threats

03:36.079 --> 03:38.590
to force the community to submit?

03:45.800 --> 03:48.710
This martial world
is called what it is for a reason.

03:49.590 --> 03:50.400
Mr. Xiao,

03:51.190 --> 03:52.920
it's not as simple as you think.

03:54.079 --> 03:54.970
When people gather,

03:54.970 --> 03:57.020
their bonds naturally fall apart.

03:57.800 --> 03:59.610
If I don't use strong-arm tactics

03:59.610 --> 04:01.140
to make these sects obey me,

04:01.840 --> 04:03.440
I'm afraid the martial world

04:04.360 --> 04:07.430
will never be united.

04:09.030 --> 04:10.800
If fear makes them obey,

04:11.280 --> 04:13.870
then I'll play the villain.

04:15.680 --> 04:18.600
Unity shouldn't be built on fear.

04:19.600 --> 04:20.529
On the contrary,

04:21.029 --> 04:23.710
Nantian Abyss proved

04:24.650 --> 04:27.410
that the martial world
values righteousness.

04:31.680 --> 04:33.610
Do you think without the Power Gang

04:34.370 --> 04:37.580
the martial world would be better?

04:40.480 --> 04:41.159
No.

04:42.159 --> 04:43.820
But right now, your Power Gang

04:44.310 --> 04:47.000
is only making the martial world worse.

04:49.190 --> 04:51.190
You want to unite the martial world,

04:52.000 --> 04:53.530
but your methods are wrong.

04:56.040 --> 04:58.170
You have your way of the martial world,

04:58.190 --> 04:59.600
and I have mine.

05:00.720 --> 05:02.050
Our ways are different,

05:03.000 --> 05:06.480
but our goal is the same.

05:08.310 --> 05:09.070
Chief Li,

05:09.560 --> 05:10.720
why did you

05:11.390 --> 05:12.790
summon me here this time?

05:21.350 --> 05:22.480
To form an alliance.

05:28.190 --> 05:30.160
The killers who massacred the Xiao family

05:30.160 --> 05:31.960
and the traitors of my Power Gang

05:32.580 --> 05:33.659
all used this item.

05:34.720 --> 05:36.920
We found this
on a Northern Wastelander

05:37.159 --> 05:38.680
who broke into Nantian Abyss.

05:38.680 --> 05:40.680
It seems your eldest brother, Xiao Yiren,

05:40.680 --> 05:43.310
was being used by them.

05:44.870 --> 05:45.630
So that means

05:46.120 --> 05:47.950
those who wiped out the Xiao family

05:47.950 --> 05:50.280
and the traitors who harmed the Power Gang

05:50.680 --> 05:52.280
are the same group of people.

05:55.310 --> 05:56.040
Mr. Xiao.

05:56.800 --> 05:57.510
Tell me—

05:58.120 --> 06:00.920
who is really
pulling the strings behind all this?

06:04.360 --> 06:05.620
Unfortunately, so far

06:06.120 --> 06:07.780
I haven't been able to uncover

06:08.070 --> 06:10.270
his true identity in the martial world.

06:10.680 --> 06:11.540
I have a feeling

06:12.070 --> 06:13.070
that his real goal

06:13.680 --> 06:15.610
is more complicated than we think.

06:28.950 --> 06:30.070
If that's the case,

06:31.630 --> 06:33.690
we need this alliance more than ever.

06:33.860 --> 06:35.130
Right now the only lead

06:35.600 --> 06:37.530
is the Marrow-Disrupting Finger.

06:37.870 --> 06:38.560
Mr. Xiao,

06:39.530 --> 06:40.730
what do you think?

06:45.200 --> 06:46.800
With the Power Gang's style,

06:47.150 --> 06:49.080
how can this be called an alliance?

06:49.500 --> 06:51.560
It's more like mutual exploitation.

06:53.070 --> 06:53.750
Chief Li,

06:54.430 --> 06:57.310
you want me
to find this person, don't you?

06:58.120 --> 06:59.950
Actually, I'm leaving tomorrow

07:01.600 --> 07:04.060
to confront Deng Qingfeng
of the Hailin Sect

07:04.390 --> 07:06.720
and Fei Yuqiao
of the Fei family in person.

07:08.920 --> 07:09.630
Good.

07:10.750 --> 07:12.360
What do you want, Mr. Xiao?

07:13.830 --> 07:14.830
Feel free to ask.

07:19.310 --> 07:20.570
Coming here this time,

07:20.630 --> 07:21.750
I do want

07:22.830 --> 07:24.290
to ask Chief Li for a favor.

07:25.160 --> 07:25.750
Go ahead.

07:27.740 --> 07:29.100
The Power Gang's Herbal King

07:29.100 --> 07:31.030
is skilled in a unique healing art.

07:31.480 --> 07:32.390
I have a friend

07:32.980 --> 07:34.980
whose father has a strange illness.

07:35.720 --> 07:38.390
I need you
to send the Herbal King to treat him.

07:38.870 --> 07:42.000
Sending the Herbal King
to treat someone at the Tang Sect

07:42.270 --> 07:43.600
would be a bit improper.

07:44.159 --> 07:46.310
But, Mr. Xiao,

07:47.350 --> 07:48.950
I'll make the arrangements.

07:49.600 --> 07:50.730
Thank you, Chief Li.

07:51.330 --> 07:52.390
I'll take my leave.

08:14.800 --> 08:16.830
You're still awake this late?

08:21.190 --> 08:23.520
The insects are so loud
that I can't sleep.

08:32.230 --> 08:34.230
Are you thinking about your father?

08:44.530 --> 08:46.190
Father has been ill for years,

08:47.030 --> 08:49.830
and it's been six months
since I left the Tang Sect.

08:50.170 --> 08:51.630
I thought I would find news

08:51.870 --> 08:53.530
of Crazy Yan at Nantian Abyss,

08:56.910 --> 08:58.370
but it was all for nothing.

09:07.660 --> 09:08.430
Tang Fang.

09:10.510 --> 09:12.040
I believe there's more than

09:12.200 --> 09:14.150
just the Voidheart Codex

09:15.030 --> 09:16.490
that can save your father.

09:17.920 --> 09:21.800
Others are searching for a cure too.

09:23.080 --> 09:23.790
I believe

09:25.440 --> 09:26.600
we'll find a way.

09:30.060 --> 09:30.890
I hope so.

09:54.640 --> 09:59.900
[Tomb of the late Father Xiao Xilou
and the late Mother Sun huishan]

10:20.470 --> 10:32.740
[Xiao Residence]

10:27.240 --> 10:29.320
I can't go with you on this journey.

10:29.910 --> 10:31.640
You must be careful on the road.

10:35.480 --> 10:36.240
Don't worry.

10:36.960 --> 10:40.550
I've asked the Herbal King
to accompany you back to the Tang Sect.

10:40.550 --> 10:41.550
Wait here for him.

10:42.320 --> 10:45.200
He may be able
to cure your father's illness.

10:48.280 --> 10:48.990
Thank you.

10:50.480 --> 10:52.480
We'll be waiting for your good news.

10:55.440 --> 10:56.040
Brothers,

10:56.840 --> 10:58.240
take care of yourselves.

10:58.840 --> 10:59.740
-Don't worry, Big Brother.
-Don't worry, Big Brother.

10:59.740 --> 11:01.340
Leave everything here to us.

11:20.150 --> 11:21.410
Ladies and gentlemen,

11:22.030 --> 11:22.960
as they say,

11:23.270 --> 11:24.870
life in the martial world...

11:25.080 --> 11:25.600
Sir,

11:26.480 --> 11:27.380
two bowls of noodles, please.

11:27.380 --> 11:28.910
Sure! Please wait a moment.

11:28.910 --> 11:29.840
Coming right up.

11:32.110 --> 11:32.720
Yuhan,

11:33.510 --> 11:34.970
once we pass through this market,

11:34.970 --> 11:36.550
we'll be at your home soon, right?

11:36.550 --> 11:37.000
Yes.

11:39.150 --> 11:41.290
I remember
you haven't been home for a long time.

11:41.290 --> 11:43.890
Why don't you
bring some gifts for your family?

11:48.200 --> 11:50.960
You know how it is
between my father and I.

11:52.080 --> 11:52.750
Forget it.

11:55.670 --> 11:56.440
I remember

11:57.440 --> 12:00.200
your family has practiced
swordsmanship for generations.

12:00.200 --> 12:01.260
I don't understand

12:01.910 --> 12:05.320
why Uncle Deng would learn
the Marrow-Disrupting Finger.

12:06.080 --> 12:08.030
My father was obsessed with martial arts,

12:08.030 --> 12:09.290
but unfortunately...

12:09.750 --> 12:10.510
the Hailin Sect's

12:10.510 --> 12:12.390
Qianxi branch has been in decline.

12:12.390 --> 12:14.910
So my father
decided to learn from various styles

12:14.910 --> 12:16.710
to infuse new life into our sect.

12:17.550 --> 12:18.390
Years ago,

12:18.840 --> 12:21.100
he learned techniques from other sects,

12:22.750 --> 12:24.480
the Marrow-Disrupting Finger

12:25.030 --> 12:26.240
might be one of them.

12:32.670 --> 12:33.870
Since I can remember,

12:34.150 --> 12:37.000
my father has lived in seclusion
and was rarely seen.

12:37.000 --> 12:39.510
Few people in our sect
ever saw him either.

12:41.150 --> 12:43.000
Over these years,
as I've traveled the martial world,

12:43.000 --> 12:46.030
we've grown a little distant.

12:47.960 --> 12:48.890
But Big Brother,

12:49.840 --> 12:51.320
I absolutely refuse to believe

12:51.320 --> 12:51.910
that my father could be

12:51.910 --> 12:54.310
the one who murdered
Mr. Xiao and Mrs. Xiao.

12:54.540 --> 12:56.690
Still, since he's a suspect,

12:57.670 --> 12:59.470
it is only right for me to face him

13:00.270 --> 13:02.000
and get a clear answer from him.

13:04.870 --> 13:05.510
Yuhan,

13:06.390 --> 13:08.600
if we can clear up Uncle Deng's suspicion,

13:08.600 --> 13:11.150
we'll find the real culprit sooner.

13:25.150 --> 13:26.960
[Huanhua Sect]

13:42.960 --> 13:43.480
Yulan,

13:44.400 --> 13:45.160
I'm back.

13:45.810 --> 13:47.560
[Hailin Sect, Eldest daughter,
Deng Yulan]

13:51.840 --> 13:53.360
Yulan, long time no see.

13:53.570 --> 13:54.500
Long time no see.

13:55.560 --> 13:56.530
You haven't been home in ages.

13:56.530 --> 13:57.840
Go see Father in the study first.

13:57.840 --> 13:59.600
I'll take Qiushui to the main hall.

13:59.600 --> 14:00.080
Sure.

14:00.080 --> 14:01.880
Big Brother, I'll go ahead then.

14:02.870 --> 14:03.930
Let's go, Qiushui.

14:10.510 --> 14:11.080
Father.

14:18.630 --> 14:19.360
Qiushui.

14:20.120 --> 14:21.910
You must be hungry after a long journey.

14:21.910 --> 14:22.510
Come here.

14:23.440 --> 14:25.300
I've prepared a meal just for you.

14:25.790 --> 14:26.550
After you finish this meal,

14:26.550 --> 14:28.080
Father will come to see you.

14:30.120 --> 14:30.750
Yulan,

14:31.150 --> 14:33.480
thank you for your hospitality.

14:34.270 --> 14:35.200
Enjoy your meal.

14:35.510 --> 14:36.670
I'll go check on Father.

14:36.670 --> 14:37.150
Okay.

14:37.240 --> 14:37.720
Please.

15:32.030 --> 15:32.760
Big Brother.

15:38.600 --> 15:39.410
Tie him up first,

15:39.410 --> 15:40.630
and wait for word from Zhu the Great King.

15:40.630 --> 15:41.290
Yes, ma'am.

15:43.870 --> 15:44.530
Where is he?

15:45.720 --> 15:46.960
Search for him! Quickly!

15:46.960 --> 15:48.560
-Understood!
-Understood.

15:53.720 --> 15:54.870
Qiushui, how could you...

15:54.870 --> 15:55.480
Yulan.

15:55.790 --> 15:56.600
Sorry.

15:57.360 --> 15:57.910
Tell me—

15:58.600 --> 15:59.730
where is Uncle Deng?

16:06.390 --> 16:07.270
Uncle Deng.

16:08.630 --> 16:09.690
I know you're home.

16:10.990 --> 16:12.230
I don't want to fight.

16:15.040 --> 16:16.300
Please show yourself.

16:20.240 --> 16:21.440
How dare you!

16:21.870 --> 16:24.910
Are you trying to make a move
at my Hailin Sect?

16:49.270 --> 16:51.670
This Lion Roar skill
makes one's body go numb

16:51.670 --> 16:52.980
and give them a splitting headache.

16:52.980 --> 16:56.380
I didn't expect Uncle Deng's
internal energy to be so strong.

16:56.840 --> 16:57.840
Xiao Qiushui.

16:58.440 --> 17:00.960
I know nothing
about what happened to your family.

17:00.960 --> 17:03.360
For the sake
of your friendship with my son,

17:03.750 --> 17:05.400
I won't make things difficult
for you today.

17:05.400 --> 17:06.550
Leave now.

17:07.960 --> 17:08.619
Uncle Deng,

17:09.589 --> 17:10.589
I came here to uncover

17:10.589 --> 17:12.790
the true culprit who murdered my parents.

17:12.790 --> 17:14.450
Please meet me face-to-face.

17:15.510 --> 17:17.440
You just won't accept my kindness!

17:17.750 --> 17:19.810
Don't blame me for what happens next.

17:28.640 --> 17:29.970
The smell of saltpeter.

17:30.450 --> 17:33.780
So he's using mechanical tricks
to control hidden weapons.

17:40.850 --> 17:41.640
Uncle Deng,

17:42.960 --> 17:45.560
your internal energy
isn't that strong at all.

17:46.310 --> 17:48.240
You might as well show yourself now.

17:48.240 --> 17:49.550
Nonsense!

17:50.140 --> 17:51.380
Prepare to die!

17:56.550 --> 17:57.240
Uncle Deng.

17:58.960 --> 18:00.490
It's time for you to show up.

18:08.870 --> 18:10.470
Marrow-Disrupting Finger.

18:21.120 --> 18:23.850
Why does he appear
to have a weak internal energy?

18:24.800 --> 18:25.320
Father!

18:26.270 --> 18:26.880
Father!

18:27.270 --> 18:28.670
Are you alright, Father?

18:28.880 --> 18:29.960
Father!

18:32.110 --> 18:32.840
Big Brother.

18:33.310 --> 18:34.510
Why did you two fight?

18:36.720 --> 18:37.350
Yuhan,

18:38.810 --> 18:40.740
Uncle Deng has internal injuries.

18:40.750 --> 18:42.280
Let's sit him down and talk.

18:43.030 --> 18:43.640
Father.

18:48.160 --> 18:48.720
Father.

18:53.160 --> 18:53.720
Yuhan,

18:54.350 --> 18:56.440
your father
has multiple damaged meridians.

18:56.440 --> 18:58.100
The palm strike I just gave him

18:58.110 --> 18:59.920
caused his vital energy to reverse.

18:59.920 --> 19:01.320
I didn't know about this.

19:01.830 --> 19:02.680
Uncle Deng.

19:03.480 --> 19:04.270
I apologize.

19:05.030 --> 19:05.760
Big Brother,

19:06.110 --> 19:07.720
my father's internal energy is strong.

19:07.720 --> 19:10.250
How could his meridians
suddenly be injured?

19:12.840 --> 19:13.400
Yuhan,

19:13.950 --> 19:16.630
Uncle Deng may have
his unspeakable reasons.

19:20.200 --> 19:22.000
This curved wall in your home...

19:22.000 --> 19:23.400
It's called an echo wall.

19:23.480 --> 19:24.880
If you stand close
to the corner of the wall,

19:24.880 --> 19:27.280
your voice can be amplified a hundredfold.

19:28.030 --> 19:30.000
Even someone with average internal energy,

19:30.000 --> 19:31.590
once amplified a hundredfold,

19:31.590 --> 19:33.310
can make enough sound
to intimidate people.

19:33.310 --> 19:34.510
And these mechanisms

19:34.910 --> 19:37.170
are used to ignite the saltpeter blasts.

19:38.550 --> 19:39.550
So Uncle Deng,

19:40.050 --> 19:41.010
this is how

19:41.960 --> 19:42.960
you've preserved

19:44.130 --> 19:46.150
the Deng family’s reputation
all these years.

19:46.150 --> 19:46.700
Father.

19:48.140 --> 19:49.540
What's exactly going on?

19:51.070 --> 19:51.790
Uncle Deng.

19:52.400 --> 19:53.120
I know...

19:54.550 --> 19:56.680
I shouldn't pry into others' secrets.

19:57.200 --> 19:59.600
But about the massacre
of my Xiao family...

20:00.310 --> 20:02.510
there's more to this than meets the eye.

20:04.000 --> 20:06.000
The culprit who murdered my parents

20:06.880 --> 20:09.410
is skilled
in the Marrow-Disrupting Finger.

20:10.440 --> 20:11.840
That's why I came here...

20:11.880 --> 20:13.310
to investigate.

20:14.240 --> 20:15.900
Please tell me, Uncle Deng...

20:18.200 --> 20:20.460
On the day the Sword Manor was destroyed,

20:20.960 --> 20:22.820
did you visit the Xiao Residence?

20:28.270 --> 20:28.880
Father.

20:29.270 --> 20:30.730
What Qiushui said is true.

20:30.880 --> 20:32.280
Please tell us the truth,

20:32.920 --> 20:35.110
so that Qiushui can find

20:35.110 --> 20:37.640
the murderer
of Mr. Xiao and Mrs. Xiao sooner.

20:43.960 --> 20:44.880
My injuries...

20:45.360 --> 20:48.160
they all began

20:49.030 --> 20:51.030
with the incident at Baicao Valley.

21:01.070 --> 21:02.310
In Baicao Valley...

21:03.000 --> 21:04.800
I was hit by a thunder-fire bomb.

21:04.960 --> 21:06.480
All my meridians were severed,

21:06.480 --> 21:08.280
and I lost all my martial skills.

21:08.480 --> 21:10.200
Although I survived,

21:10.790 --> 21:12.030
all my martial skills

21:13.960 --> 21:14.720
were gone.

21:24.070 --> 21:25.400
For the past 15 years...

21:25.950 --> 21:27.880
I've secluded myself to practice,

21:28.110 --> 21:30.350
hoping to recover my previous skills.

21:31.750 --> 21:32.880
But so far

21:35.110 --> 21:37.960
I've only regained about 10 percent.

21:39.550 --> 21:40.400
Uncle Deng.

21:41.070 --> 21:41.880
So that means

21:42.720 --> 21:44.180
you've had these injuries

21:45.590 --> 21:46.830
for 15 years?

21:48.590 --> 21:49.350
The Marrow-Disrupting Finger

21:49.350 --> 21:52.150
requires tremendous
internal energy to perform.

21:53.110 --> 21:55.750
I can no longer control it.

21:57.030 --> 21:58.000
All these years,

21:58.160 --> 22:00.290
I've renovated the mansion many times

22:00.510 --> 22:02.400
just to set up some mechanisms

22:02.880 --> 22:05.140
to hide the fact that I've lost my skills.

22:05.960 --> 22:07.000
When I was young,

22:07.720 --> 22:10.880
with my Marrow-Disrupting Finger
and the Hailin Sword Technique,

22:10.880 --> 22:11.920
I gained quite a reputation

22:11.920 --> 22:13.720
in the martial world.

22:14.550 --> 22:15.410
Because of that

22:17.160 --> 22:19.560
I also made many enemies
who wanted me dead.

22:20.440 --> 22:21.920
Back then, only Mr. Xiao

22:21.920 --> 22:23.980
knew I had lost all my martial skills.

22:24.110 --> 22:25.770
I begged him to keep my secret.

22:26.590 --> 22:28.320
Although in the martial world,

22:28.920 --> 22:30.720
there were many rumors about me,

22:31.790 --> 22:32.510
still,

22:34.310 --> 22:36.960
they didn't know
the real reason behind it.

22:42.200 --> 22:44.200
Uncle Deng joined Zhu the Great King

22:45.160 --> 22:46.820
just to find a powerful backer

22:48.110 --> 22:49.910
to fight against the Power Gang.

22:52.240 --> 22:52.790
Father,

22:55.000 --> 22:56.660
you joined Zhu the Great King?

22:57.200 --> 22:57.880
I...

22:59.160 --> 23:00.880
had my reasons for doing so.

23:01.720 --> 23:03.590
Seeing all the allied sects

23:03.590 --> 23:04.920
fall one after another,

23:05.240 --> 23:07.440
even the Huanhua Sect was caught in it.

23:08.480 --> 23:10.680
I knew that all of this

23:11.200 --> 23:13.590
was Liu Suifeng's doing.

23:14.830 --> 23:17.750
By then, I had already lost
my martial skills.

23:18.480 --> 23:21.510
If I hadn't joined Zhu the Great King,

23:23.720 --> 23:25.050
how could I have ensured

23:25.350 --> 23:27.480
any chance of survival for our family?

23:30.160 --> 23:30.920
So that's why

23:32.270 --> 23:34.800
you refused to help
the Xiao family back then.

23:35.200 --> 23:37.330
Regarding the Xiao family's tragedy,

23:39.830 --> 23:41.830
I do feel guilty about it.

23:52.590 --> 23:53.830
But I have to tell you,

23:54.310 --> 23:56.920
I had nothing to do with it.

23:57.110 --> 23:58.200
I'm innocent.

23:58.750 --> 23:59.550
But today,

24:00.400 --> 24:01.790
to help you find

24:01.790 --> 24:04.120
the real killer who murdered your father,

24:04.790 --> 24:06.590
I will no longer hide anything.

24:19.550 --> 24:20.310
Forgive me.

24:35.750 --> 24:38.400
Grand Master Dayin's
Return-to-Breath method.

24:38.400 --> 24:40.030
If the meridians are only damaged

24:40.030 --> 24:41.030
and not necrotic,

24:41.310 --> 24:44.300
one can still ask Grand Master Dayin
to repair them with golden needles.

24:44.300 --> 24:47.900
But if the Return-to-Breath
cannot flow through the meridians,

24:48.110 --> 24:49.040
then it means...

24:50.750 --> 24:51.440
Senior.

24:52.070 --> 24:52.790
Forgive me.

24:57.750 --> 24:58.350
Father...

25:07.200 --> 25:07.830
Father.

25:08.490 --> 25:09.180
Father.

25:10.550 --> 25:11.200
Senior.

25:12.070 --> 25:13.110
I'm so sorry.

25:13.960 --> 25:17.030
Your injuries are old.

25:18.310 --> 25:21.040
Now you can only recover
10 percent of your power.

25:28.310 --> 25:29.000
It's fine.

25:30.830 --> 25:32.590
I accepted this fact long ago.

25:33.790 --> 25:34.790
My only hope now

25:36.110 --> 25:36.970
is for my family

25:38.590 --> 25:40.550
to stay safe.

25:42.120 --> 25:42.840
Father.

26:05.880 --> 26:07.070
Liu Suifeng.

26:15.030 --> 26:16.310
Liu Suifeng,

26:17.160 --> 26:18.750
I knew you would come.

26:19.480 --> 26:21.010
If you're here for revenge,

26:21.310 --> 26:22.510
then just kill me.

26:23.510 --> 26:25.110
Right now, my biggest regret

26:25.440 --> 26:27.750
is not killing you, the son of a traitor,

26:27.880 --> 26:29.780
when I had the chance—

26:30.070 --> 26:33.110
allowing you to harm
the martial world today.

26:34.160 --> 26:35.830
You keep calling me a traitor.

26:37.510 --> 26:40.830
Today, I will make sure
you die knowing the truth.

26:49.590 --> 26:52.960
This is the testimony of Yuchi Qing,
an assassin from the Northern Wasteland.

26:52.960 --> 26:55.240
Baicao Valley has always been reclusive

26:56.000 --> 26:57.960
and never dealt
with the Northern Wasteland.

26:57.960 --> 26:59.290
The pills my mother made

26:59.310 --> 27:02.960
were originally for the poor.

27:04.270 --> 27:07.000
When the Northern Wastelanders
learned of this,

27:07.510 --> 27:09.200
they wanted them as military supplies.

27:09.200 --> 27:10.590
After their demands were refused,

27:10.590 --> 27:13.240
they spread rumors
throughout the martial world

27:13.240 --> 27:15.500
and ruined Baicao Valley's reputation.

27:18.000 --> 27:18.730
Impossible.

27:19.310 --> 27:20.040
Impossible.

27:21.240 --> 27:24.170
There were
Northern Wastelanders in Baicao Valley!

27:24.240 --> 27:26.680
Back then, we got a tip
that Baicao Valley was colluding

27:26.680 --> 27:29.610
with Northern Wastelanders
to make Marching Pills.

27:30.110 --> 27:32.510
So, under Mr. Xiao's leadership,

27:33.310 --> 27:36.440
we went to Baicao Valley to investigate.

27:44.160 --> 27:44.960
Chief Liu,

27:45.400 --> 27:48.110
I promise that once we enter the valley,

27:48.640 --> 27:51.350
we won't harm anyone without cause.

27:51.790 --> 27:53.450
If we don't find any evidence,

27:53.940 --> 27:56.050
I, Xiao, am willing

27:56.480 --> 27:58.790
to apologize to Baicao Valley.

27:59.160 --> 27:59.750
No way!

28:00.160 --> 28:01.350
Baicao Valley is not a place

28:01.350 --> 28:03.590
you can just come
and search based on false charges.

28:03.590 --> 28:04.680
We may be weak,

28:04.830 --> 28:06.360
but we're the most upright,

28:06.590 --> 28:08.510
and we won't allow you
to trample and humiliate us.

28:08.510 --> 28:08.920
That's right!

28:08.920 --> 28:10.650
What do you think this place is?

28:16.110 --> 28:16.830
What should we do now?

28:16.830 --> 28:17.960
What does this mean?

28:24.790 --> 28:25.480
Mr. Xiao.

28:25.790 --> 28:26.270
They...

28:27.640 --> 28:29.100
Should we force our way in?

28:29.680 --> 28:30.200
No.

28:30.590 --> 28:33.000
Give Chief Liu some time to consider.

28:33.590 --> 28:34.350
I believe

28:35.400 --> 28:37.830
she will make the right decision.

28:38.640 --> 28:39.400
Back then,

28:40.160 --> 28:41.720
Mr. Xiao gave your mother

28:42.200 --> 28:44.000
a chance to prove her innocence.

28:44.590 --> 28:47.240
But she was so stubborn.

28:49.510 --> 28:52.590
If she had nothing to hide,

28:53.030 --> 28:54.680
why would she react that way?

28:55.240 --> 28:57.370
You came to Baicao Valley like bandits

28:58.470 --> 29:00.270
yet you expected a warm welcome?

29:00.830 --> 29:02.720
Besides, you say one thing,

29:03.030 --> 29:05.160
but in the end,
you broke into my home

29:05.790 --> 29:07.470
and brutally slaughtered my people

29:07.470 --> 29:09.200
without distinction.

29:12.550 --> 29:13.350
Mother!

29:15.920 --> 29:16.510
Mother!

29:18.270 --> 29:18.880
Mother!

29:22.590 --> 29:23.310
Mother!

29:27.200 --> 29:28.000
Mother!

29:33.830 --> 29:36.750
I watched my mother die before my eyes.

29:38.400 --> 29:39.440
And my people...

29:40.310 --> 29:42.790
all turned into cold, lifeless bodies.

29:44.000 --> 29:45.130
In such a short time,

29:46.790 --> 29:49.750
you didn't interrogate or gather evidence,

29:51.030 --> 29:52.630
you just started a massacre.

29:52.920 --> 29:54.310
It was because Baicao Valley's people,

29:54.310 --> 29:56.070
seeing their crimes
were about to be exposed,

29:56.070 --> 29:58.170
wanted to kill us to silence us.

29:59.560 --> 30:02.740
[Shijushan Monastery]

30:17.750 --> 30:19.150
What on earth is going on?

30:28.110 --> 30:29.040
What's going on?

30:30.310 --> 30:30.960
Hurry!

30:31.360 --> 30:33.020
They're moving the evidence!

30:39.960 --> 30:40.960
Marching Pills!

30:46.110 --> 30:47.510
Northern Wastelanders?

30:47.550 --> 30:51.810
Baicao Valley was really making
Marching Pills for the Northern Wasteland.

30:52.790 --> 30:54.070
So many witnesses

30:54.590 --> 30:55.960
saw Northern Wastelanders

30:55.960 --> 30:58.350
moving Marching Pills in Baicao Valley.

30:58.790 --> 31:00.190
How can you still deny it?

31:00.310 --> 31:01.200
How do you know

31:01.360 --> 31:04.350
it wasn't one of your people
who colluded with the Northern Wasteland,

31:04.350 --> 31:06.880
stole the
Marching Pill formula in disarray,

31:07.110 --> 31:08.370
killed the witnesses,

31:08.510 --> 31:09.970
and then buried the truth?

31:10.160 --> 31:10.960
Nonsense!

31:11.270 --> 31:12.510
Before we entered the valley,

31:12.510 --> 31:13.350
we already saw

31:13.350 --> 31:15.070
the ledger recording
Baicao Valley's transactions

31:15.070 --> 31:16.880
with Northern Wastelanders
for Marching Pills.

31:16.880 --> 31:19.410
Every transaction
was documented in detail.

31:19.590 --> 31:21.400
Our brothers
guarding the back of the mountain

31:21.400 --> 31:23.270
caught you trying to move the evidence,

31:23.270 --> 31:24.310
and were brutally killed,

31:24.310 --> 31:25.440
with no survivors.

31:25.880 --> 31:28.210
Baicao Valley's collusion with the enemy

31:28.640 --> 31:30.200
is undeniable!

31:30.830 --> 31:32.680
Undeniable?

31:36.240 --> 31:37.590
Who brought the ledger?

31:40.200 --> 31:42.440
Who's behind this?

31:43.240 --> 31:44.590
I... I...

31:47.350 --> 31:48.270
I don't know.

31:50.590 --> 31:51.350
Fine.

31:53.160 --> 31:56.340
It seems I'll have
to make you suffer a little.

32:03.480 --> 32:04.880
Now I'm even more curious

32:05.240 --> 32:08.550
who you're protecting so much.

32:09.110 --> 32:10.010
If we had known

32:10.350 --> 32:12.590
you would become such a villain today,

32:13.480 --> 32:17.550
Mr. Xiao should never have
saved your life back then.

32:22.880 --> 32:23.810
What did you say?

32:24.160 --> 32:28.680
Back then, Mr. Xiao
found you half-dead,

32:29.440 --> 32:32.200
he kindheartedly saved your life,

32:32.880 --> 32:35.840
and had someone take you to the Tang Sect.

32:36.560 --> 32:38.920
That's why you're alive today.

32:48.200 --> 32:48.880
Mother...

32:50.440 --> 32:51.240
Go check over there.

32:51.240 --> 32:52.570
There's someone alive.

32:53.350 --> 32:54.210
Careful. Come.

32:56.720 --> 32:57.380
Be careful.

33:00.880 --> 33:02.480
There's someone alive here!

33:02.750 --> 33:03.400
Wake up.

33:16.310 --> 33:17.030
Tang Sect?

33:20.160 --> 33:21.550
Which family are you from?

33:21.550 --> 33:22.200
I am...

33:22.720 --> 33:23.850
from the Liu family.

33:24.000 --> 33:25.530
You're from the Liu family?

33:26.310 --> 33:27.440
But I never expected

33:27.560 --> 33:30.750
you would lead
the Power Gang to siege the Xiao family.

33:31.750 --> 33:32.880
Is there any justice

33:33.510 --> 33:35.440
in this world?

33:38.000 --> 33:39.800
Just because you spared my life,

33:41.030 --> 33:43.160
you claim to be kind-hearted?

33:44.030 --> 33:45.490
I'll ask you one last time—

33:46.920 --> 33:50.550
who brought the ledger back then?

33:57.160 --> 33:57.790
Fine.

34:01.350 --> 34:03.550
Let's see what's tougher—

34:04.350 --> 34:06.080
your stubbornness or my fists.

34:15.000 --> 34:15.880
Say it!

34:19.650 --> 34:20.340
Master.

34:20.710 --> 34:21.440
Master.

34:22.280 --> 34:23.280
If you don't talk,

34:23.630 --> 34:25.960
I'll come back tomorrow and ask you again.

34:33.190 --> 34:33.710
Father.

34:34.920 --> 34:35.550
Come in.

34:45.800 --> 34:46.360
Father.

34:47.360 --> 34:48.449
Yulan is resting now.

34:48.449 --> 34:49.110
She's fine.

34:50.440 --> 34:51.030
Good.

34:52.230 --> 34:53.489
How are your injuries?

34:55.440 --> 34:55.969
I'm fine.

34:57.190 --> 34:57.840
Alright.

34:58.510 --> 34:59.230
Have a seat.

35:00.030 --> 35:00.510
Okay.

35:13.350 --> 35:13.950
Father,

35:14.590 --> 35:15.990
are you hiding something

35:16.840 --> 35:18.770
about the Baicao Valley incident?

35:19.320 --> 35:20.030
Nonsense!

35:21.840 --> 35:23.100
I have nothing to hide.

35:26.400 --> 35:27.530
Others may not know,

35:27.710 --> 35:29.030
but I know you well.

35:30.280 --> 35:31.340
Every time you lie,

35:32.260 --> 35:33.430
your eyes look down.

35:35.920 --> 35:36.360
You...

35:36.380 --> 35:36.980
Father...

35:38.230 --> 35:40.070
Liu Suifeng is a ruthless man.

35:40.630 --> 35:41.760
Once he targets us,

35:43.510 --> 35:45.970
the Hailin Sect
will never have peace again.

36:03.590 --> 36:05.050
This is your favorite tea.

36:13.000 --> 36:13.920
What are you doing?

36:13.920 --> 36:16.250
You just got home.
Where are you going now?

36:20.710 --> 36:22.170
I'm going to find Qiushui.

36:24.030 --> 36:26.030
A sect allied with Zhu the Great King

36:28.110 --> 36:30.150
is no better than the Power Gang.

36:33.000 --> 36:34.000
At dawn tomorrow,

36:35.630 --> 36:37.030
I'll leave with Qiushui.

36:43.070 --> 36:43.710
Father.

36:44.550 --> 36:46.350
I hope you can come to your senses

36:49.070 --> 36:50.600
and stop disappointing me.

37:36.590 --> 37:38.670
A sect allied with Zhu the Great King

37:39.590 --> 37:41.480
is no better than the Power Gang.

37:48.550 --> 37:49.150
Father.

37:50.510 --> 37:52.400
I hope you can come to your senses

37:54.480 --> 37:56.010
and stop disappointing me.

38:03.960 --> 38:04.890
What's going on?

38:05.000 --> 38:05.880
What on earth is going on?

38:05.880 --> 38:06.510
Hurry!

38:07.130 --> 38:08.790
They're moving the evidence.

38:54.950 --> 39:01.550
[Qianxi Inn]

38:56.360 --> 38:57.030
It's this one.

38:57.030 --> 38:57.560
Let's go.

38:59.590 --> 39:00.230
Yuhan.

39:00.900 --> 39:01.510
Yulan?

39:03.280 --> 39:05.010
Something happened to Father.

39:14.510 --> 39:16.820
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

39:16.840 --> 39:21.550
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

39:19.280 --> 39:19.740
Father.

39:21.810 --> 39:24.160
♪ The wind blows ♪

39:24.190 --> 39:28.630
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

39:29.230 --> 39:31.680
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

39:31.700 --> 39:34.170
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

39:34.190 --> 39:37.300
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

39:35.110 --> 39:35.670
Father!

39:37.990 --> 39:45.270
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

39:46.190 --> 39:46.650
Father.

39:47.980 --> 39:48.520
Father.

39:48.010 --> 39:50.320
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

39:50.340 --> 39:55.050
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

39:50.590 --> 39:51.110
Father.

39:52.710 --> 39:53.570
Don't scare me.

39:55.310 --> 39:57.660
♪ The wind blows ♪

39:55.480 --> 39:56.070
Father!

39:57.690 --> 40:02.130
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

40:02.730 --> 40:05.180
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

40:05.200 --> 40:07.670
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

40:05.670 --> 40:06.320
Father.

40:07.690 --> 40:10.800
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

40:08.190 --> 40:08.840
Father!

40:11.440 --> 40:12.590
How could this happen?

40:11.490 --> 40:18.770
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

40:13.630 --> 40:14.360
Big Brother.

40:15.230 --> 40:15.800
Yulan.

40:17.590 --> 40:19.000
How could this happen?

40:20.840 --> 40:21.510
Father.

40:21.370 --> 40:23.820
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

40:23.320 --> 40:23.880
Father.

40:23.840 --> 40:26.310
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

40:26.280 --> 40:27.320
Father.

40:26.330 --> 40:29.440
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

40:30.000 --> 40:37.280
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

40:41.360 --> 40:42.760
Uncle Deng's fatal wound

40:44.400 --> 40:45.930
is the one behind his heart.

40:46.960 --> 40:50.480
This was caused
by a hidden weapon from the Tang Sect.

40:51.920 --> 40:52.720
Besides that,

40:54.730 --> 40:57.730
there are many other wounds
caused by external force.

41:00.150 --> 41:01.750
I've examined these wounds.

41:02.310 --> 41:03.570
It must be Liu Suifeng.

41:04.280 --> 41:05.940
These wounds on Father's body

41:06.200 --> 41:07.860
all match the shape of his fan.

41:08.670 --> 41:09.840
It's my fault.

41:10.840 --> 41:11.440
Father.

41:12.450 --> 41:13.340
I'm sorry.

41:14.590 --> 41:16.450
I shouldn't have argued with you.

41:17.070 --> 41:18.920
I shouldn't have said those things.

41:18.920 --> 41:20.850
Most of all, I shouldn't have left!

41:23.800 --> 41:24.670
Father.

41:29.190 --> 41:31.000
It's all my fault.

41:32.870 --> 41:34.060
Father.

41:37.710 --> 41:38.630
Father.

41:42.000 --> 41:43.070
Father.

41:47.760 --> 41:48.510
Father.

41:49.880 --> 41:52.070
Father, it's all my fault.

41:54.400 --> 41:57.060
I should have stayed
and protected you, Father.

41:57.400 --> 41:58.670
It's my fault.

41:59.030 --> 42:00.150
I'm sorry.

42:01.110 --> 42:01.800
Look.

42:02.400 --> 42:04.670
Half of the paper was torn off.

42:05.920 --> 42:06.710
I suspect

42:07.180 --> 42:08.870
Uncle Deng was trying to
leave a message for you.
